# Storage

Separate module — not learning / Simple / News.

## Data

- Collection `user_storage`: `{ user_id, title, contents, filename, content_type, file_size, binary_data, created_at, updated_at }`
- `binary_data` is BSON `Binary` (max ~12 MB — under Mongo 16 MB doc limit)
- Index `(user_id, updated_at)` via `create_indexes`

## API (`/storage`)

- Auth JWT; multipart form for create/update (`title`, `contents`, optional `file`, update may send `clear_file=1`)
- `GET /storage`, `GET /storage/{id}`, `GET /storage/{id}/file`, `POST /storage`, `PUT /storage/{id}`, `DELETE /storage/{id}`
- List responses omit `binary_data` and usually omit full `contents`

## FE

- `/storage` + nav **Storage**; Save sends `FormData` via `useApi()`
